                    "value": "<p>A creature that takes damage from a lurker in light's mote of light Strike must attempt a @Check[will|dc:22] save.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to lurker's glow for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is lined in golden light for 1 minute and can't be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] during this time. If the creature becomes invisible, it's concealed rather than undetected.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature sheds bright light in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:20] for the duration of the effect. In addition, the creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] until the end of its next turn.</p>"
