                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The lurker in light has reduced a living creature to 0 Hit Points on this turn or their previous turn and has a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Summon Fey] innate spell available</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The lurker in light casts summon fey with only a concentrate trait, using the act of slaughter to replace the normal manipulate traits for the spell. If the fey creature summoned shares the lurker in light's current goals, the lurker in light can sustain the summon fey spell for up to 1 hour instead of 1 minute.</p>"
